Package: plasma5support
Version: @DEB_PLASMA5SUPPORT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/plasma-desktop/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, kf6-config, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-guiaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-service, kf6-solid, kf6-notifications
Description: Plasma 5 compatibility support for Xios
 Plasma5Support provides the Plasma::Plasma5Support library and
 org.kde.plasma.plasma5support QML import used by Plasma Mobile shell
 components that have not fully moved to newer Plasma 6 APIs.
 .
 This iOS bring-up package intentionally skips legacy data engines that require
 KSysGuard until the broader hardware/service package wave is ready.
